# Copy to /home/pbuchman/services/sentrybox/env with mode 0600.
# The file owner UID/GID must match ERROR_HUB_RUNTIME_UID/GID used by Compose.
#
# Add only credentials named by ERROR_HUB_REQUIRED_SECRET_REFERENCES. Initial
# shadow forwarding requires the four legacy Sentry DSN references below.
# Add the two Code Agent HMAC references only during the controlled live
# transition, at the same time as the required-reference list. Never store Hub
# DSN public keys here.
#
# Example names (values intentionally omitted):
# LEGACY_SENTRY_DSN_BACKEND_DEV=
# LEGACY_SENTRY_DSN_BACKEND_PROD=
# LEGACY_SENTRY_DSN_WEB_DEV=
# LEGACY_SENTRY_DSN_WEB_PROD=
# CODE_AGENT_HMAC_DEV=
# CODE_AGENT_HMAC_PROD=
